{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to build a monster while your friends bother you to take breaks. Play as a mage/scientist and decide how to prioritize your time as you construct the monster. This short interactive narrative is part monster-dress-up game, part friend-dating simulator, and all how-not-to-deal-with-loss advice column. Will you fall into despair or climb back out of the well?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/ec1962c9ce8da43c156cebadcc6df0e1.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character's name and pronouns. Choose up to six pronouns, including neopronoun options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/bace5dbdf14ce2261145d0a84fb86c8e.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what materials you use to make each part of your monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/661983c4775fed97f48bb195b658d552.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect and learn about your neglected friends as you develop your monster. Wade through complex emotions to decide what they each mean to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/341bb3da0c2370c57f3280cb39c51e83.poster.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/341bb3da0c2370c57f3280cb39c51e83.webm?t=1762629055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/341bb3da0c2370c57f3280cb39c51e83.mp4?t=1762629055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/e3ec349f88723a02b71e8c1eb9c3b356.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move through the game, experience time passing. As your character shifts and changes, so will the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/4f2448ca6e8c66da5fe9f2a9910a4530.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with beautiful, hand-drawn illustrations created with a blend of digital and traditional art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/extras/d8c83e6bce0acbbc76faae174c42ff15.avif?t=1762629055\" width=1560 height=252 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a love letter to friendship and to community. To those who feel an insatiable urge to create, and to those who lose themselves in their art and lock themselves away. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047160?t=1762629055","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047160?t=1762629055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047160/ae128a9be5055ef16fa1eb49a49d14f9da82c4cd/capsule_231x87.jpg